<v Slow>日本に住む外国人の人口は、およそ何万人になりましたか。

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:53.056
<v Host>About four million, thirty-one thousand — a record high, and the first time above four million.

00:11:53.655 --> 00:12:17.871
<v Host>That's all for today. As of January first this year, Japan's Japanese population fell below one hundred twenty million for the first time in forty-two years, after a record drop of about nine hundred seventeen thousand people. Tokyo was the only prefecture that grew, while foreign residents topped four million for the first time. Thanks for listening, and see you tomorrow.

00:12:18.471 --> 00:12:20.871
<v News>また明日。
